{
  "description": "Eukaryotic cell-structure lab — a config-declared organelle roster the learner tours with Prev/Next; the selected organelle enlarges with a highlight ring and its function is narrated, and a progress readout tracks the tour. A plantMode knob adds chloroplast, cell wall, and central vacuole. Standalone by default; behind a lab router set matchMode and it renders only when MODE_SELECTED matches.",
